    "body": {
      "from": "DUNCAN_PRIME_W01_PIXEL_RIG_PATH_PROOF_R01\n\nMAIN = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nTRACKER = #248\nSOURCE = exact accepted C00-C MASTER FRONT, SHA256 57fbec5d9c136a90c6ac262f8011665fa061dca427bf3fb2c3f110d1cb0a69ed\n\nRESULT = SOURCE-PRESERVING 2D PUPPET/WARP PATH PROVEN AS A REAL CAUSAL ALTERNATIVE TO FREE GENERATION.\n\nMethod proof:\n- keep non-active character pixels unchanged;\n- isolate Duncan-right arm/sleeve from exact source;\n- rotate/warp around shoulder pivot onto expanded diagnostic canvas;\n- reconstruct only the newly exposed local shoulder-cap/armpit/side-jacket region;\n- no new face/body/costume generation.\n\nInternal proof artifact = ZORR_W01_ARM_RAISE_PIXEL_RIG_PROOF_R04.png\nSHA256 = 71c3266a6642040b8fa2e4002e3f719280e71a2664bc2893285eb70554414d56\n\nIMPORTANT: this proof is NOT a W01 candidate and NOT PASS. It still contains visible cleanup defects in the shoulder/armpit join and remnants/negative space from the arm's original position. Those defects are local and bounded; identity preservation is no longer the primary blocker.\n\nFIRST REAL BLOCKER = local 2D animation cleanup of shoulder-cap / armhole / armpit / exposed jacket side + erase original-arm residue, while preserving all other accepted Duncan pixels.\n\nNEXT = refine only that local region -> fresh #248 matrix QC -> W01 PASS/FAIL.\n\nW01 = NOT PASS\nCOSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 = NOT PASS\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVE = NO\nNO FREE-GENERATION RETRY."
    }
